      "en": {
         "seven_days": "The figure above shows the forecast for the 7-day interval between 12/25/2024 e 12/31/2024, forecast of precipitation deficits (orange) in the far east and south of the region, over the main course of the Amazon River in Brazilian territory and the basins of the Abacaxis, Aripuanã, Beni, Curuá Una, Guaporé, Iriri, Ji-paraná, Mamoré, basins on the left bank of the Amazon River in the northeast of the state of Pará, Tapajós, Teles Pires, Ucayali and Xingu rivers. Forecast of positive rainfall anomalies (blue) in isolated areas over the main course of the Amazon River in Peruvian territory, basins on the left bank of the Amazon River in the northeast of the state of Amazonas and the Napo River basin. Rainfall close to climatology (white) in other areas of the monitored region.",
         "fourteen_days": "The figure above shows the prognosis for the 14-day interval between 12/25/2024 e 01/07/2025, precipitation deficit forecast (orange) in the east, southeast and south of the region, over the main course of the Amazon River in Brazilian territory and the basins of the Abacaxis, Aripuanã, Branco, Coari, Curuá Una, Guaporá, Iriri, Ji-paraná, Juruá, Juruena, Jutaí, Madeira, Mamoré, Marañon, basins on the left bank of the Amazon River in the northeast and northwest of the state of Pará, Purus, Tapajós, Tefé, Teles Pires, Ucayali, Xingu and the main course of the Solimões River. Forecast of positive rainfall anomalies (blue) over the Napo River basin. Rainfall close to climatology (white) in the other areas of the monitored region."
